)-00.05.41.510.png", "id": "727715513342883", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391924_727715516676216_8478215564952713292_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=x7hHQgcAR58Q7kNvwH6EDwi&_nc_oc=AdqL6z8TMztZjye9u1qLVvYJqZwbdttCFsjxV7F4byiCOsEy90QxYfh1wb0lF1RB8ew&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfygZz8FGVROCbHMNMSvmGW6wqboGN9f1Yh9pZyr5xgl-w&oe=69C284D0"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Pickleball One - Meta Store - Landscape - Characters (2560 x 1440 px)_N2.png", "id": "655074343587217", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391811_655074346920550_5301919247206989097_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KvZEYtDcAnMQ7kNvwErxj5W&_nc_oc=AdorYnf5H6ztavX33EAQT0B_lGQSzBkCwNdldp6uYFZOZksGA5KdUc1W2ryG9a8wtAw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Afyrpk3Ki1beZ9NqKXi25ILs7lnZP_QIOdKYLomCnLVSIg&oe=69C28758"}, "display_name": "Pickleball One Demo", "keywords": ["racket", "sports", "tennis", "racquet", "workout"], "long_description": "# EXPERIENCE THE FUTURE OF PICKLEBALL\nPickleball One Demo gives you a **14-Day** glimpse of the exciting gameplay and community that awaits. Explore cutting-edge VR physics, single-player matches, mixed reality gameplay, fitness features, and introductory training\u2014all from the comfort of your home.\n{638775075561987}\n# WHAT'S INCLUDED IN THE DEMO:\n- **Realistic Physics**: Experience authentic, responsive gameplay.\n- **Single-player Matches**: Enjoy practice and competitive match scenarios.\n- **Mixed Reality Gameplay**: Immerse yourself in a unique blend of virtual and real-world play.\n- **Fitness and Training**: Experience introductory fitness features and targeted practice.\n{581303474955457}\n\n# UPGRADE FOR FULL ACCESS: \nUnlock multiplayer matches, ranked competition, comprehensive training modules, ongoing content updates, and become part of our vibrant, engaging pickleball community.\n\n{2071089853326010}\n# COMMON QUESTIONS:\n**Does the demo require a lot of space?** No. Pickleball One Demo is designed for home use, requiring minimal space.\n\n**How do I upgrade to the full game?** Upgrade directly within the app or visit www.pickleballone.app to join the full experience.\n\n**Need help or have questions?** Join our community on Discord or reach us at support@playingames.net.\n\n\n", "short_description": "EXPERIENCE THE FUTURE OF PICKLEBALL\nPickleball One Demo gives you a 14-Day glimpse of the exciting gameplay and community that awaits. Explore cutting-edge VR physics, single-player matches, mixed reality gameplay, fitness features, and introductory training\u2014all from the comfort of your home.\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://pickleballone.app/privacy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Future World Software", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://pickleballone.app/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2776542286000603"}, {"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE", "SITTING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "9637213693036573"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1163844412193708"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1163844412193708"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1743609300, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1163844412193708"}]}, "live